Package: enigma2-plugin-extensions-fritz-call
Version: 1.0.0
Section: extra
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: madoe21 <https://github.com/madoe21>
Depends: enigma2, ca-certificates
Description: FritzCall – incoming call notifications and call history for Enigma2.
 Displays caller name/number (resolved from FritzBox phonebook) on the TV
 screen and/or LCD display.  Shows a filterable call history (All / Missed /
 Answered / Outgoing).  Requires a Fritz!Box router.
